SDD: sortingplus_preset (STALKER GAMMA 0.9.5)

1. Purpose
Custom inventory sorting preset for SortingPlus (RavenAscendant). Reorders
medicine, ammo parts, belt items, drinks and utility tools without changing
the relative order of the other categories.

2. Components
- gamedata/configs/sortingplus.ltx
  Replaces the original config ([item_kind_order], [kind_overrides],
  [sortingplusmcm]).
- gamedata/scripts/zz_default_favorites.script
  Seeds a default favorites set once per save.

3. Design: sortingplus.ltx
- Rank scale: all original ranks x10 (integers only); ties between categories
  are preserved. New kinds fit between old ranks.
- New kinds:
  - i_attach (50): belt items (plates, freon...), placed above i_arty (51).
  - i_med_top (60): rebirth, stimpack, stimpack_army, stimpack_scientic,
    medkit, medkit_army, medkit_scientic, bandage, jgut. Followed by
    i_medical (61).
  - i_drink (90) before i_food (91); i_mutant_cooked stays tied to i_food.
  - w_ammo_part (71), directly after w_ammo (70): casing_*, powder_*,
    bullet_* (15 crafting component sections).
- Each kind starts a new inventory row, so related items share one kind to
  avoid row breaks. Order inside a kind is decided by SortingPlus.
- New kinds are registered in the [sortingplusmcm] category lists.

4. Design: zz_default_favorites.script
- On actor_on_first_update, calls zzz_rax_sortingplus_mcm.set_favorite(sec, true)
  for the sections: itm_advancedkit, itm_basickit, itm_expertkit,
  itm_drugkit, itm_ammokit, e_syringe, jar, prt_i_plastic, swiss_knife,
  grooming, leatherman_tool, armor_repair_fa, sewing_kit_b.
- Each section is seeded once (flag stored in the save via save_state /
  load_state), so a player can remove it from favorites and it will not return.
- Sections already marked as junk are skipped.

5. Dependencies
- SortingPlus (RavenAscendant), with "Use sortingplus.ltx" enabled in MCM.
- Mod must be installed below the original SortingPlus in the MO2 load order.

6. Known limitations
- Seamless Inventory Sort: its "ammo_parts_row" option overrides the rank of
  ammo parts (absolute ap_order, default 9.5) and breaks custom scales.
  Disable it in MCM (see bug report).
- Order of items inside one kind is not controllable from the config.
- The zz_default_favorites.script is based on SortingPlus source code;
  section names must match the game's item sections.